+> This skill supplies **composition, attitude and restraint**. It does NOT supply the
+> typeface or the palette. Ignore every specific font name and hex code in it:
+>
+> - **Fonts (sec. "Optimal Web Fonts", both variants):** Inter and Roboto Flex are
+>   popularity 5 and 2 - the two most-used typefaces on the web, and the single fastest
+>   generic tell. Neue Haas Grotesk and Monument Extended are commercial and cannot be
+>   self-hosted. Playfair Display is popularity 25 and Times New Roman is a system font.
+> - **Palette:** `#E61919` / `#FF2A2A` Aviation Red is one hardcoded accent applied to
